source: crates/instrukt-cli/tests/harness.rs
expression: help
---
Attributed commits and commit-review stamps

Usage: instrukt repo <COMMAND>

Commands:
  commit  Commit as the acting agent: its configured git author, a `Session:` trailer when a
          runtime's session variable is set, `Human-Involved:` always, and `Todo:` or
          `Planned-Todo:` with --todo. Outside an agent session the commit is the git user's own.
          Prints the commit's id
  stamp   Record a commit-review verdict with the report's digest, or an exemption with its reason,
          as a git note on each named commit
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
